:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=WRKLNKH.Work with Object Links - Help
:P.The objects the path names, with the options that work on them.
A directory's contents show with option 5; a stream file shows with
option 5 and edits with option 2. A command typed on the command line
runs as typed.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=DSPLNKH.Display Object Links - Help
:P.The objects the path names. Option 5 shows a directory's contents
or a stream file's data.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=DSPATRH.Display Attributes - Help
:P.What the integrated file system keeps for the object: its type,
owner, coded character set, PC flags, sizes and times.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=KEYSHLP.Function keys - Help
:P.F3 leaves the display, F12 goes back one display, F5 reads the
directory again, F23 shows the other options.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
